<title>USA: Alpine Lace Brands Q3 shr falls to $0.10.</title>
<headline>Alpine Lace Brands Q3 shr falls to $0.10.</headline>
<dateline>MAPLEWOOD, N.J. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.10		    $0.18</p>
<p> Net			    656		    1,002</p>
<p> Sales		     53,116		   37,241</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,226		    5,363</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.26		    $0.60</p>
<p> Net			  1,551		    3,233</p>
<p> Sales		    123,234		  103,686</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,249		    5,286</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>1995 Q3 results use an 18 percent effective tax rate due to prior years' tax loss carry forwards. Pro forma results applying a 38 percent tax rate would have been $757,592 or $0.13 per share.</p>
<p>1995 nine months use a 13 percent effective tax rate. Pro forma results on 38 percent tax would have been nearly $2.3 million or $0.42 per share.</p>
<p>Full company name is Alpine Lace Brands Inc.</p>
</text>
